sequenceDiagram
accTitle: Cross-account private DNS association
accDescr: The zone owner authorizes a VPC, its owner then creates the association before that VPC can resolve zone records.
participant Z as Central DNS account
participant R as Route 53
participant V as VPC owning account
participant A as Application in VPC
Z->>R: Authorize zone + VPC association
V->>R: Associate VPC with zone
R-->>V: Association established
Z->>R: Delete unused authorization
A->>R: Query through VPC Resolver
R-->>A: Private record answer
Note over V,A: DNS support and hostnames enabled
